NOTE FOR ELECTION DEPLOYMENT

This Software implements cryptographic voting protocols. Deployment in any binding public 
election requires, at minimum:

1. An independent, published security audit of the full stack.
2. A legal framework defining the treatment of cryptographic proofs as evidence in electoral courts.
3. A pre-agreed, legally grounded election abort/extend procedure.
4. Physical key ceremonies with multi-organization witnesses.

These requirements are described in the system architecture document.